  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−1</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #5d275d;\n  --accent: #ef7d57;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --shadow: #0d0e17;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--shadow);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--shadow);\n  text-align: center;\n  width: min(100%, 400px);\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 24px 0;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--shadow);\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--shadow);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff9a6e; }\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--shadow);\n}\n#reset { background: var(--text); }\n#reset:hover { background: #ffffff; }\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  #count { font-size: 3rem; }\n  button { padding: 10px 14px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  render();\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nAn offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Everything works offline.\n\n## Usage\n\n- **+1** (`#increase`): adds one to the count.\n- **−1** (`#decrease`): subtracts one from the count (negative numbers supported).\n- **Reset** (`#reset`): sets the count back to zero.\n\nThe current integer is shown in the `#count` output element. All buttons are keyboard-accessible with visible focus states and ARIA labels.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and controls\n- `styles.css` – pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` – counter logic",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
